{%- comment -%}
  Product information panel.

  Rendered from sections/product-information.liquid rather than added to
  templates/product.json as a section: Shopify's GitHub sync stopped applying
  changes to that JSON template (its live copy is pinned to an older version
  while every Liquid file in the same pushes deploys normally), so the content
  has to arrive through a Liquid file to reach the store at all.

  These three bodies of text used to be accordions inside the buy column,
  where they competed with the price and the add to cart button for the same
  narrow strip, and pushed the button down the page every time one opened.

  Layout: the description leads at a reading measure, with the practical
  facts beside it as a short labelled list.

  The panel sits on its own white surface because that is this store's actual
  language: on the product page every element, the media card, the buy column,
  each product card below, is a white rounded card on the beige ground. An
  earlier pass set unstyled text directly on that ground, which read as content
  that had escaped its container rather than as a section.

  Inside the surface it is deliberately underfilled. The text measure stops at
  56 characters well before the column ends, the padding is close to twice the
  usual card padding, and the first paragraph is set larger than the rest so
  the description opens rather than starts. Luxury here is bought with space
  and restraint, not with more elements.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign panel_product = product -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Width is matched to the product card above by using the same container
  chain that card sits in (section section--page-width) and the same 85%
  cap it takes at desktop, rather than page-width-content, which resolves
  to the narrow page width and came out a different size.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="product-info-panel section section--page-width">
  <div class="product-info-panel__surface">
    <div class="product-info-panel__grid">
      <div class="product-info-panel__col">
        <h2 class="product-info-panel__title">על היצירה</h2>
        {% if panel_product.description != blank %}
          <div class="product-info-panel__lead rte">{{ panel_product.description }}</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <dl class="product-info-panel__facts">
        <div class="product-info-panel__fact">
          <dt>החומר</dt>
          <dd>MDF פרימיום בעובי 6 מ״מ, חיתוך לייזר מדויק, ובדגמים המוארים תאורת לד רכה מבפנים.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="product-info-panel__fact">
          <dt>זמן אספקה</dt>
          <dd>יוצא תוך 1 עד 3 ימי עסקים, מגיע תוך 2 עד 6 ימי עסקים.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="product-info-panel__fact">
          <dt>החזרות</dt>
          <dd>14 יום להחזרה, משלוח ההחזרה על חשבוננו.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% style %}
  .product-info-panel {
    padding-block: 8px 88px;
  }

  .product-info-panel__surface {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    /* Same surface color and shadow as the product card above, so the two
       read as one material rather than as two different panels. */
    background-color: #f7f5f2;
    border-radius: 32px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    padding: 88px 80px 96px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Matches [data-template='product'] .product-information__grid. */
  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    .product-info-panel__surface {
      max-width: 85%;
      margin-inline: auto;
    }
  }

  .product-info-panel__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.75fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 96px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .product-info-panel__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: #1a1a2e;
    margin: 0 0 40px;
    padding-block-end: 22px;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* A short gold rule under the heading rather than a full width divider:
     the same accent the cards carry, used once, at reading scale. */
  .product-info-panel__title::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset-block-end: 0;
    inset-inline-start: 0;
    width: 48px;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(to left, rgba(74, 74, 84, 0.75), rgba(74, 74, 84, 0.12));
  }

  .product-info-panel__lead {
    max-width: 56ch;
    color: #4a4a55;
  }

  .product-info-panel__lead p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 2.05;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
  }

  /* The opening paragraph is set larger so the description opens rather
     than simply starting. */
  .product-info-panel__lead p:first-child {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #2a2a35;
    margin-block-end: 30px;
  }

  .product-info-panel__lead p:last-child {
    margin-block-end: 0;
  }

  /* Each fact used to be one stacked list with a hairline between items -
     the generic "spec sheet with border-b on every row" default. Three
     separate soft-tinted cards instead, so the facts read as distinct
     small statements rather than rows in a table. */
  .product-info-panel__facts {
    margin: 0;
    padding-block-start: 4px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .product-info-panel__fact {
    padding: 22px 24px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(26, 26, 46, 0.035);
    border-inline-start: 2px solid var(--color-accent-amber, #e8a33d);
  }

  .product-info-panel__fact dt {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    color: rgba(26, 26, 46, 0.4);
    margin-block-end: 14px;
  }

  .product-info-panel__fact dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #33333d;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 1199px) {
    .product-info-panel__surface {
      padding: 64px 56px 72px;
    }

    .product-info-panel__grid {
      gap: 64px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .product-info-panel {
      padding-block: 0 56px;
    }

    .product-info-panel__surface {
      padding: 44px 28px 48px;
      border-radius: 22px;
    }

    .product-info-panel__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
    }

    .product-info-panel__title {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      margin-block-end: 32px;
    }

    .product-info-panel__lead p:first-child {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}
